    "result_text": "The build succeeds. `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class, and it passes along with the full compilation (MapStruct regeneration included).\n\nThe change is complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `displayName` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` includes the field.\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` on `toOwnerDto` that computes `displayName` as `lastName + \", \" + firstName` from the stored names.\n\nThis keeps the formatting logic in the mapper (the single place responsible for Owner\u2192OwnerDto translation) rather than scattering it into the controller, and it applies uniformly to every response that maps an `Owner` (create, get, list), so the `GET /api/owners/{id}` read-back in the test returns `\"LastName, FirstName\"`.",
